      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "Now that we have seen a overview about express js and how it's\ndiffrent from node:http.createServer()\n\nso basically express.js is a backend framework to build api\nthrough which client communicate :\n\nNow these backend api take http request process that request \nand give back an http response :\n\nNow there are different type of http request sent by browser \nin order to receive data ,create data ,update data and delete data\nthese type are GET,POST,PUT,PATCH and DELETE also known\nas https/http method or http verb\n\nso when we make our backend to deal with different type \nof http method ,we have route handler these route hnadler are \nattach  a endpoint to a method for example url/api that is\nthe endpoint receives perticular type of request from client\nand to resolve that address we attach the type of method that \nendpoint may get request for ",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now that we have seen a overview about express js and how it's\ndiffrent from node:http.createServer()\n\nso basically express.js is a backend framework to build api\nthrough which client communicate :\n\nNow these backend api take http request process that request \nand give back an http response :\n\nNow there are different type of http request sent by browser \nin order to receive data ,create data ,update data and delete data\nthese type are GET,POST,PUT,PATCH and DELETE also known\nas https/http method or http verb\n\nso when we make our backend to deal with different type \nof http method ,we have route handler these route hnadler are \nattach  a endpoint to a method for example url/api that is\nthe endpoint receives perticular type of request from client\nand to resolve that address we attach the type of method that \nendpoint may get request for ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 536,
      "versionNonce": 2015419427,
      "index": "bSU",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "O7VTAtu65gPXNEjpq_ZAt",
