      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "/fetchUser-->binded(GET Method)\n\n\nand this how we create backend api and client or frontend will use these api\nto send and receive data,theses backend api -endpoints are binded with which will\nbe sent from client side",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "/fetchUser-->binded(GET Method)\n\n\nand this how we create backend api and client or frontend will use these api\nto send and receive data,theses backend api -endpoints are binded with which will\nbe sent from client side",
      "autoResize": true,
