      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "Even if we have a simple html frontend we can't use put request just \nwith simple html form cause simple html form supports only two method\nget and post so to use put method we need to add dom and \najax js but that's complicated so for now we will use \npostman -api tool",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Even if we have a simple html frontend we can't use put request just \nwith simple html form cause simple html form supports only two method\nget and post so to use put method we need to add dom and \najax js but that's complicated so for now we will use \npostman -api tool",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
