      "version": 44,
      "versionNonce": 1477425059,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730434616180,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "app.get('/users/:userId', (req, res) => {\nconst userId = req.params.userId;\nres.send(`User ID: ${userId}`);\n});\n\nIn this example, the server responds with “User ID: 123” for the request to “/users/123”.",
      "fontSize": 14.211779535217493,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "app.get('/users/:userId', (req, res) => {\nconst userId = req.params.userId;\nres.send(`User ID: ${userId}`);\n});\n\nIn this example, the server responds with “User ID: 123” for the request to “/users/123”.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8ZVFDElEeqmz5eWjK7q2L",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 818.7182217981463,
      "y": 46429.06649064132,
      "width": 533.1223997994986,
      "height": 96.12750222267961,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bUS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 883142861,
      "version": 126,
      "versionNonce": 1338171651,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730435262200,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dynamic routing in Express.js is powerful for building APIs and\nweb applications\nwhere different routes are needed to handle various operations\nand functionalities\nbased on user input or other contextual information.",
      "fontSize": 15.380400355628737,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dynamic routing in Express.js is powerful for building APIs and web applications \nwhere different routes are needed to handle various operations and functionalities \nbased on user input or other contextual information.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dQlXTH8Oi-Vq3BYp5MVKz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 816.8188867899277,
      "y": 46548.26978076885,
      "width": 609.4124122881908,
      "height": 32.96798741432458,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bUT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1885437165,
      "version": 99,
      "versionNonce": 1509396387,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730435265766,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Suppose we have a database with user record for ease of example lets take a inmemory\ndatabase record",
      "fontSize": 13.187194965729836,
