      "text": "now here we have total of 4 user \nso if we have to access each user data we can create route for each user ",
      "fontSize": 12.838776150628126,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "now here we have total of 4 user \nso if we have to access each user data we can create route for each user ",
      "autoResize": true,
