      "seed": 646840013,
      "version": 107,
      "versionNonce": 1065700163,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730435535406,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "so that's why we use dynamic Routing\n\napp.get(\"/:user-name\",(req,res)=>{\n    let len=userData.length;\n    let getRecord;\n    for(let i=0;i<len;i++)\n    {   \n        if(req.param.user-name===userData[i].userName)\n        {\n            getRecord=userData[i];\n            break;\n        }\n    }\n    res.json(getRecord);\n});\n\n\nNow all we have to do is go to browser and which ever userData we need\nwe can type localhost:3000/Shivansh or localhost:3000/Rishi it will give us the output",
      "fontSize": 11.88821336869393,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "so that's why we use dynamic Routing\n\napp.get(\"/:user-name\",(req,res)=>{\n    let len=userData.length;\n    let getRecord;\n    for(let i=0;i<len;i++)\n    {   \n        if(req.param.user-name===userData[i].userName)\n        {\n            getRecord=userData[i];\n            break;\n        }\n    }\n    res.json(getRecord);\n});\n\n\nNow all we have to do is go to browser and which ever userData we need\nwe can type localhost:3000/Shivansh or localhost:3000/Rishi it will give us the output",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
