      "updated": 1730451820816,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now let's add post method \nroute to it to add\nmore data in our in memory data base",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now let's add post method \nroute to it to add\nmore data in our in memory data base",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4GD_yL0ktzzXqmcMonjhi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 554.9626934816524,
      "y": 60432.64434240637,
      "width": 545.7992553710938,
      "height": 380,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bVx",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 458106642,
      "version": 515,
      "versionNonce": 826388878,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1730454817553,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "First we need to create a html form or use api tool for now \nlets create a form to understand how form is used to post data\n\nso let's create a from:\n\n<html>\n<head>\n    <title>Create</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <form action=\"/createUser\" method=\"POST\">\n    <label for=\"name\">Name</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" name=\"userName\">\n    <label for=\"age\">Age</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" name=\"userAge\">\n    <input type=\"submit\" value=\"submit\">\n</body>\n</html>\n    ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "First we need to create a html form or use api tool for now \nlets create a form to understand how form is used to post data\n\nso let's create a from:\n\n<html>\n<head>\n    <title>Create</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <form action=\"/createUser\" method=\"POST\">\n    <label for=\"name\">Name</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" name=\"userName\">\n    <label for=\"age\">Age</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" name=\"userAge\">\n    <input type=\"submit\" value=\"submit\">\n</body>\n</html>\n    ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YUDNnjZ2oCup77xAyKF-h",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 557.3048878306527,
      "y": 60805.41367692825,
      "width": 515.3669189155279,
      "height": 256.03616793611616,
