      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\"/req.js\" route is a bit special \nroute as our update.html page which \nis served on /updateUser route \nhas a javascript page req.js \nso the  server will request \nlocalhost:3000/req.js so to serve\nthat req.js page we made this route \nthis is another method \nto server static page that is \nexpress.static() which we will cover\nlater",
      "fontSize": 12.628675157852497,
