      "text": ".sort() method will sort the array but since \nthis array is object so we need to sort that\narray of object using a key and that key here\nis userName of object \n\na.userName > b.userName it returns true that \na object userName is greater than b object \nuserName so we need to sort and swap a and b object\n\n",
