      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dynamic routing /:user_name now here in our browser \nsearch engine we replace user_name with some value \nwe dont provide any keyword but just value \nlike if we need Shivansh username detail we will \ngive localhost:3000/Shivansh then our route handler \nwill execute the code to search the user",
      "fontSize": 17.154577134680817,
